{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1211124001:0":{"text":"The moment you stepped onto the island, you entered Ulmus' dream. This is also where the treasure is.","source_cn":"这里确实是梦境，也是藏宝之地。从你们登上小岛的那一刻起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8CC6964D297533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211124002:0":{"text":"Ulmus... isn't this the name of the tree?","source_cn":"奥曼斯……不是那棵树吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D19AA8FC8FB6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211124003:0":{"text":"Exactly! You have an excellent memory!","source_cn":"哎呀，真可爱！你的记性真好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66154FBE54395BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211124004:0":{"text":"Let me reintroduce myself! I'm Tasi, sometimes known as <style=\"highlight\">the fairy of dreams</style>. As you may have guessed, I'm the guardian of this place.","source_cn":"那么，让我重新做个自我介绍吧。我是这里的保卫者，<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81868C628A1BD2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211124005:0":{"text":"Following Tritonus' orders, Ulmus and I guard the treasure he hid within the realm of dreams.","source_cn":"奉特勒米琉斯的嘱托，我和奥曼斯在此地守护着风浪与漂泊之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB98A0C209A03D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211124006:0":{"text":"Brave adventurers, you've demonstrated your will and strength. As a reward, I will give you the treasure.","source_cn":"各位冒险家，你们证明了自己的意志与实力，因此，我会将宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A514E40A710D9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211124007:0":{"text":"It will be something you <style=\"highlight\">long for the most</style>. The thing that <style=\"highlight\">dwells within your deepest dreams</style>.","source_cn":"那将是各位<style=highlight>最想要的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0FCEED57BDD6F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211124008:0":{"text":"Sonja can have mine!","source_cn":"我的让给索尼娅姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5788E5595DACE4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211124009:0":{"text":"Oh, poor little thing... It almost hurts me to tell you that you don't get to pick the treasure.","source_cn":"唉，可怜又可爱的小家伙……虽然这么说很可惜，但是你没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CB1D32FAFB9786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211124010:0":{"text":"But don't you worry! Your sister will definitely get what she wants!","source_cn":"但是别担心！你的姐姐一定能拿到她想要的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x753A81CB06BB4891","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211124011:0":{"text":"Why can't Nara choose?","source_cn":"为什么奈拉没有资格？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0BD653313AB07B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211124012:0":{"text":"Take your reward before you ask any questions.","source_cn":"提问之前，先拿走你们的奖品吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9666F27478398FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211124013:0":{"text":"So, Sonja, tell me what you've always wished for.","source_cn":"来吧，索尼娅，告诉我，你的梦寐之物是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A78B255691BC1FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211124014:0":{"text":"What is it that you see right now?","source_cn":"此时此刻你的眼中，看到了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7BC07621CDC88BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211124015:0":{"text":"A staff symbolizing the power of the Carmine Whispers, and...","source_cn":"你是说……这柄血蔷薇权杖？和……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7987761B8950CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211124016:0":{"text":"And? Remember, your treasure is something only you can see.","source_cn":"和什么呢？你的宝藏，只有你自己能看到哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D344C17E92F77C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211124017:0":{"text":"Nara's bow and a paper boat she made...","source_cn":"另一个，是奈拉的蝴蝶结和她折的纸船……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72D701791C617C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211124018:0":{"text":"Is it a hard choice? Have you been struggling with how to choose all this time?","source_cn":"很难抉择吗？直到现在，你都在纠结应该怎么选？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DCDCE88C767D1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211124019:0":{"text":"No...","source_cn":"不是的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1047DD05087B3BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1211124020:0":{"text":"Don't be greedy. I can't give you everything. Please pick the one you want the most.","source_cn":"可不能贪心哦，我不能全都给你，只能给你最想要的那一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191EC3AEF4535CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1211124021:0":{"text":"I've made up my mind. My life won't change based on the choice I make here.","source_cn":"……不必了。我的人生，不会因为在这里做出选择而有所改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C6066A36F3450CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211124022:0":{"text":"I have to take Nara back to Rustport and fight off the Dead Tide Fleet. No matter what choice I make, it won't change what I have to do next.","source_cn":"我要带奈拉回锈锚港，赶走死潮舰队。无论怎么选，都不会影...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DBCD3E7BBBB09B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1211124023:0":{"text":"How interesting... It's the first time I've met someone willing to forgo the treasure.","source_cn":"有意思……第一次碰到愿意放弃宝藏的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86968592E3C73DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1211124024:0":{"text":"Since you've made your decision, I wish you luck.","source_cn":"我不会强迫你，既然你已经做出了你的选择，祝你好运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD95ACFC50B8D5AFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1211124025:0":{"text":"But since you've completed the trial, if you need it, you can take the chest of gold at my feet.","source_cn":"但你毕竟完成了试炼，要是需要的话，就把我脚下这箱金子拿去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C3D40DC4219755F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1211124026:0":{"text":"Alright, Sinbad, you're up next!","source_cn":"那么，接下来，到你了——辛巴达！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE5E6AF5C48870A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1211124027:0":{"text":"I'm nervous... I wonder what kind of treasure I'll get.","source_cn":"好紧张……不知道会得到什么样的宝物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x622EFEDAB7E5A0A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1211124028:0":{"text":"Look, there's a mountain of gold to your left and a mountain of silver to your right. No matter what you choose, you'll never have to worry about money again.","source_cn":"瞧，你左边是堆成金山般的财宝，右边是堆成银山般的财宝。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA68DA52DC1288CE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1211124029:0":{"text":"Huh, gold and silver...? Isn't it all just money?","source_cn":"等等……金山？银山？不都是钱吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x406F717148925949","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1211124030:0":{"text":"Haven't you always wanted wealth?","source_cn":"怎么了，你一直以来想要的不是财富吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7884A6B11D051BD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1211124031:0":{"text":"With this money, you could buy a castle and have everyone you care about move in. You could make sure they're well provided for.","source_cn":"有了这些钱，别说是庄园，连城堡都能买下来。你可以让自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5B5F1D08439A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1211124032:0":{"text":"Yes... you're right...","source_cn":"是、是啊……你说的对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB46D8A070CAA5773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1211124033:0":{"text":"Good, you better choose quickly.","source_cn":"很好，快把它拿走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB06F38B7980ED4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1211124034:0":{"text":"Money... I've always wanted money... She's right...","source_cn":"钱……没错……钱。我一直都想要钱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E00F0DC1E182DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1211124035:0":{"text":"Mmhmm. Trust me, you won't regret this.","source_cn":"对，就是这样。相信我，你不会后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0402F6A5D71FD23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:43:1211124035":{"text":"Mmhmm. Trust me, you won't regret this.","source_cn":"对，就是这样。相信我，你不会后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0402F6A5D71FD23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1211124036:0":{"text":"*Gasp* What just happened?!","source_cn":"——啊！我刚刚是怎么了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA781DCBE7BCB68C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1211124037:0":{"text":"Oh my, I almost walked right into her trap. Good thing you yelled...","source_cn":"谢谢你！要不是你喊这一嗓子，我差点中了她的计！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC72A79E5C1971055","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh my, I almost walked right into her trap. Good thing you yelled...","female":"Oh my, I almost walked right into her trap. Good thing you yelled...","variant_male_record_index":"130193","variant_female_record_index":"130194","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1211124039:0":{"text":"I've made up my mind! I know what I truly want!","source_cn":"我想清楚了！我知道自己真正想要的是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x649B73C2308C6D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1211124040:0":{"text":"You know you can't change your mind, right?","source_cn":"你要反悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x778E10DF14070BCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1211124041:0":{"text":"You didn't even give me a real choice.","source_cn":"不是反悔，而是你并没有把真正的选项摆在我面前，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9593E1D417A17B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1211124042:0":{"text":"What I want most... isn't money.","source_cn":"因为我最想要的东西……不是钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4167C91451F4007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1211124043:0":{"text":"Oh wow, that's a bit of a surprise! The person who loves gold the most doesn't want any of it.","source_cn":"什么？什么！贪财的小哥，最想要的竟然不是钱！那可怎么办呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E79A95DAD7A0F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1211124044:0":{"text":"Alright then... I do have another choice for you. But it's tattered and old. Are you sure you want it?","source_cn":"那么……我保管着另一件礼物。不过那东西破破烂烂的，你真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EDDAE87C114529D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:43:0:1":{"text":"Sinbad! Come to your senses!","source_cn":"辛巴达！清醒一点！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6E68FD0C480AD2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sinbad! Come to your senses!","female":"Sinbad! Come to your senses!","variant_male_record_index":"65508","variant_female_record_index":"65509","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1211124038:0":{"text":"Oh, harsh... There's no such thing as misleading. I'm just an innocent fairy!","source_cn":"哼……怎么能用蛊惑这么尖锐的词语呢？我可是无辜的妖精啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x340CF615B97E7B7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:43:1:2":{"text":"Tasi, stop misleading him!","source_cn":"塔西！不要蛊惑他！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE706CE12CF0D9DEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Tasi, stop misleading him!","female":"Tasi, stop misleading him!","variant_male_record_index":"65510","variant_female_record_index":"65511","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔西":{"text":"Tasi","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"Nara","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"Sinbad","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":48,"localized_text_count":47,"speaker_count":5}}